cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PreEI Version 1 in research, please cite this software.
type: software
title: "PreEI Version 1: Incremental Gain-Based Erasable-Itemset Mining"
abstract: >-
  PreEI is a C# implementation of incremental gain-based erasable-itemset
  mining using compact posting lists, a gain-based re-scanning condition,
  and prefix-based depth-first exploration. The project includes a WinForms
  interface and a GitHub Actions console runner that share the mining engine.
